(text "IN100 insect tag v6: 7 mm round tag, wire antenna, cut-to-start tail" (at 25.4 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3c9c4fe3-730c-445a-86dc-0f5ae709d450))
(text "- U1 IN100 QFN18 (JLC C6062024). VDDQ tied to VCC; unused GPIOs, switches and RTC pins left open." (at 25.4 170.434 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 092d229b-1e69-4246-9094-ed3a43ac29c4))
(text "- CHIP_EN: R1 1 Mohm pull-up on the tag. JP1 (OFF) on the tail, bridged after programming, holds it low;" (at 25.4 173.228 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1f6eaa7a-303c-498a-a731-15b4121895ea))
(text "  cutting the tail releases CHIP_EN after VCC is up (datasheet power sequence). C2 10 nF (tail) delays it while programming." (at 25.4 176.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 45963eab-bb53-4e07-a9b6-0a74c2fcec1f))
(text "- C1 47 uF 0603: carries the 9 mA TX bursts the 337 cell (~80 ohm) cannot supply alone. Use 0 dBm or less." (at 25.4 178.816 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d26343e5-548b-4f4f-9224-9160df4294bb))
(text "- Y1 26 MHz 1612, 7 pF load: the IN100's on-chip load capacitance replaces external caps." (at 25.4 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6b3a353e-a19d-4192-9742-f57f91df9e78))
(text "- AE1: ~30 mm enamelled wire in a plated hole, fed straight from RF_TX (trim to tune)." (at 25.4 184.404 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d2031f87-645d-4595-8a20-ca359cc68edf))
(text "- BT1: 337 / SR416SW under the tag: - cap silver-epoxied to the underside pad, + wire in the plated hole." (at 25.4 187.198 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8ef9bea7-41bd-4d3f-a6d8-ba54bf183d26))
(text "- J1: 2 x 2 plated pads on the tail (R T / G +). Program with 3.3 V before the cell is fitted." (at 25.4 189.992 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e6a6fde0-bf71-410c-ad9d-28e2370b7e45))
(text "Derived from the IN100 datasheet reference design and SparkFun's NanoBeacon Lite board (CC BY-SA 4.0)." (at 25.4 192.786 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d22bc8d9-db60-4702-958c-9985df7baab4))
